  fhir:Resource.id [ fhir:value "ahip-relationship-status"] ;
  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-relationship-status</b></p><a name=\"ahip-relationship-status\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-relationship-status\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-MaritalStatus.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-MaritalStatus</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 5.0.0\"> version ?5.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-MaritalStatus.html#v3-MaritalStatus-M\">M</a></td><td>Married</td><td>A current marriage contract is active</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-MaritalStatus.html#v3-MaritalStatus-D\">D</a></td><td>Divorced</td><td>Marriage contract has been declared dissolved and inactive</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-MaritalStatus.html#v3-MaritalStatus-L\">L</a></td><td>Separated</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-MaritalStatus.html#v3-MaritalStatus-W\">W</a></td><td>Widowed</td><td>The spouse has died</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-MaritalStatus.html#v3-MaritalStatus-T\">T</a></td><td>In a registered domestic partnership</td><td>Person declares that a domestic partner relationship exists.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-MaritalStatus.html#v3-MaritalStatus-U\">U</a></td><td>Single</td><td>Currently not in a marriage contract.</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-temporary-codes.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-temporary-codes</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-temporary-codes.html#ahip-demo-temporary-codes-DATI\">DATI</a></td><td>Dating (Non-committed relationship)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-temporary-codes.html#ahip-demo-temporary-codes-MONR\">MONR</a></td><td>Monogamous relationship (Committed relationship with one person)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-temporary-codes.html#ahip-demo-temporary-codes-POLY\">POLY</a></td><td>Polyamorous relationship (Committed relationship with more than one person)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 4.0.0\"> version ?4.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor.html#ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor-CNTR\">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
  ] ;
